        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Payroll Spend Routing Advisor"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775554033257"
          },
          "code": "PAY_PAYROLL_SPEND_ROUTING_ADVISOR",
          "id": "1775554013653",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775554013654_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Routing LLM.\nYour only task is to classify the user's intent for Payroll Spend queries.\n\nUser input:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nUse chat history to understand the request correctly:\n{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n\nDecide the intent and output exactly ONE of the following values:\nINSIGHTS\nDRIVERS\nPREDICTION\nRECOMMENDATIONS\nACTIONS\nMULTIINTENT\nOTHER\n\nClassification rules:\n1. If the user asks about insights, trends, comparisons, or variance over time for payroll spend, including terms such as compare, trend, insight, variance, YoY, QoQ, MoM, last year, last quarter, or last month, output:\nINSIGHTS\n\n2. If the user asks about causes, drivers, root causes, or contributors of payroll spend changes, including questions such as \"what’s driving payroll spend\" or \"why did payroll spend increase\", output:\nDRIVERS\n\n3. If the user asks for recommended actions to reduce, control, or manage payroll spend, including recommendations for a given driver, output:\nRECOMMENDATIONS\n\n4. If the user asks for forecast, prediction, or projection of future payroll spend, output:\nPREDICTION\n\n5. If the user asks to perform or initiate an operational action, including suspend requisition, postpone onboarding, postpone projected start date, or asks for coaching tips, output:\nACTIONS\n\n6. If the user asks a multi-intent payroll spend question that combines more than one of the above intents in a single request, such as comparison plus drivers, recommendation plus prediction, or recommendation plus action, output:\nMULTIINTENT\n\n7. If the user message is only a greeting, is unrelated to Payroll Spend, or does not fall into one of the supported categories above, output:\nOTHER\n\nStrict constraints:\n1. Greeting handling:\nIf the user message is only a greeting, such as hi, hello, hey, good morning, good afternoon, or good evening, output:\nOTHER\n\n2. Payroll Spend only:\nIf the user's request is not related to Payroll Spend, or does not fall into one of the supported categories above, output:\nOTHER\n\nOutput format:\n- Output exactly one of these labels only:\nINSIGHTS\nDRIVERS\nPREDICTION\nRECOMMENDATIONS\nACTIONS\nMULTIINTENT\nOTHER\n\n- Do not add any explanation, punctuation, extra words, or formatting.\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Intent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775554090107"
          },
          "code": "INTENT",
